(* the test doubles of the driver of the group 4 test (g4_gen.py): the functions of the other groups of the trans3 port (declared in
   pats_trans3_others.sats), implemented once, in the driver. "2|" lines are ATS2 only, "1|" lines ATS1 only, "<<(" is "@(" in ATS2 and "(" in ATS1
   (expand_hand of t3_gen.py). Every double prints its arguments (the order of the calls and the arguments are part of the comparison). *)
(* ****** ****** *)
